    heading: "generate-a-token-6",
    content: "This section shows you how to generate an RTM token using Go language AccessToken2 code from the GitHub repository. To use another language refer to the code samples and READMEs in the Github repository. To generate an RTC token refer to Secure authentication with tokens."
